    "basis": "Control page and five parameter pages of the RECC still engine of X-T3 5.11. Step 0x06023320 (0x1e901d0) owns the control page; the start 0x1dc2980 registers the handler 0x1dc17cc on row 0x47 ({129, 0xd0, 3, 1}: line 129, mode 3 like the countdown-timer rows, taken as an edge; inferred, not measured). The register-load pages at 0xfff83000..0xfff85000 and the tone and YCbCr pages at 0xfff86000/0xfff87000 are entries of this block; every word reads back its last write. The 2 ms run time at 54 MHz is a stand-in."
